Move openssl and openssl-sys to releases that support OpenSSL 4.

openssl-sys 0.9.111 aborts its build script on OpenSSL 4; support arrived
in openssl-sys 0.9.114 / openssl 0.10.78, and 0.9.118 / 0.10.82 add the
OpenSSL 4.1 fixes. openssl 0.10.82 no longer depends on once_cell.

